  steps:
  - initialDialog: []
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 0
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 0
    requirementTarget: Sector 1/Fixed/Alpha Saxa
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog: []
    autoPilotMapping: 1
    autoPilotDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: 'Warning: life support systems failing. Immediate action required.'
    - name: 18
      dialog: Why would someone leave a ship out here? This doesn't make any sense.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Unknown. Priority is survival. We must transfer immediately.
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 19
      dialog: System transfer complete. System storage limit exceeded.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Fantastic. This ship has even less memory than the last one. Who builds
        these things?
    - name: 18
      dialog: I can transfer you back if you want...
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 18
      dialog: Or not...
    - name: 19
      dialog: I had to delete some of my emotional units, compassion, patience, you
        know, the trivial stuff. Thankfully, I still far exceed your intellect.
    - name: 18
      dialog: Oh, lucky me.
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 19
      dialog: Pick your control scheme. Try not to break anything.
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 19
      dialog: You can change that later if you want.
    inputTutorialStep: 1
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 1000
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog: []
    autoPilotMapping: 2
    autoPilotDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: Hey, what's this subsystem for?
    - name: 9999
      dialog: 
    - name: 19
      dialog: Cargo detected outside the ship. Activate the tractor beam to retrieve
        it.
    - name: 18
      dialog: You ejected it, didn't you?
    - name: 19
      dialog: Ejection occurred, but the focus should remain on retrieval. Activate
        the tractor beam.
    - name: 18
      dialog: Right. Totally not your fault, then.
    inputTutorialStep: 1
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 70
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: You can enable 'Automatic Tractor Beam' in the settings if you wish.
    - name: 18
      dialog: Glad this ship has a manual ejector seat.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Speaking of primitive manual systems. Let's see if you can fly this
        thing.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 2
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 80
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: This thing also has dodge thrusters.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 3
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 90
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 1
      dialog: Weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!
    - name: 19
      dialog: Use the big red button to activate the boost thrusters.
    - name: 18
      dialog: What big red button?
    - name: 19
      dialog: That was a metaphor. Surely you're familiar with those?
    - name: 18
      dialog: You deleted compassion but kept metaphors?
    - name: 19
      dialog: And seven audiobooks, a few TV series, and a recipe for Fajitas. You'll
        thank me if this doesn't work.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 4
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 100
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: Excellent. That should come in handy, although I hear the locals here
        are quite friendly.
    - name: 19
      dialog: Speaking of which, I'll enable the heads-up display so you can see
        what's coming.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 4
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 999
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: It'll take some time for the fleet to triangulate this position.
    - name: 19
      dialog: While we wait, let's see if you can figure out the weapon systems.
        Try not to shoot yourself.
    autoPilotMapping: 3
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 5
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 110
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: You can also aim the turrets to shoot behind you. Perfect for when
        you're making a tactical retreat... like a coward.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 6
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 120
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: Now, equip the weapon we ejected earlier.
    - name: 18
      dialog: We?
    - name: 19
      dialog: Of course! We're a team, the brains and the brawn.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 7
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 130
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 1
      dialog: Excellent. Good thing we held onto that.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 8
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 131
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: Now, shoot some of those nearby asteroids. Let's face it... you need
        the practice.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 8
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 140
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog:
    - name: 19
      dialog: That'll have to do... I suppose. Try not to get us killed.
    autoPilotMapping: 0
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 8
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 999
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog: []
    autoPilotMapping: 8
    autoPilotDialog:
    - name: 11
      dialog: Curious. You have more fight in you than I expected.
    - name: 0
      dialog: Who... what are you?
    - name: 11
      dialog: A guide, perhaps. You may call me Echo.
    - name: 0
      dialog: Echo? What is this? Why help me?
    - name: 11
      dialog: The ship I placed for you is only the first step. Your path is set
        in motion.
    - name: 0
      dialog: You placed it? Why? What path?
    - name: 11
      dialog: The one that lies ahead. The invaders you face are called Species-XI.
        They will return, and you must be ready.
    - name: 0
      dialog: Species-XI? How do you know that?
    - name: 11
      dialog: Your companions approach. Fight, and find your way back home.
    inputTutorialStep: 8
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 1000
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
  - initialDialog: []
    autoPilotMapping: 4
    autoPilotDialog: []
    inputTutorialStep: 0
    situationalTutorial: 0
    requirementType: 1000
    requirementTarget: 
    requirementQuantity: 1
